Z||000015||Monkeyman||06-11-2001||06:33 AM||||What's everyone got against Sony?  I've got a Sony CD head unit and am planning on buying one of their subs (and probably an amp to match).  They may not be the best, but for the money, they're good quality.  Nice 10" sub for less than 100 bucks.  Of course Infinity, Polk, etc have nice 10" subs, too.  For around $300.  Hmmm...I don't need a competition system so why pay all of that money.  For the money I can save on a sub alone (and still get good quality), I can buy some lowering springs.  ||||reg||1
